{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a907ba2261f8fdf956cf9ea57417c40b097f2d829cb7fe476f1629852c06db96", "ja": "おつかれさま、育。\nおっ、新しい衣装を着ているな。", "zh": "辛苦了，育。\n哦，穿上新服装了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "c49d60294d8751167881dbdb5c77ddced57c823155ee8692b4aa43fb09ff3c55", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nどうかな？　似合ってる？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n怎么样？适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1002_p", "source_sha256": "715c2dcb194a6d0a24eb0214246502e485ec2bff93f75768c0fb1ab2fe5795c3", "ja": "うん、しっかり着こなせてると思う！\nクールでカッコイイ感じだ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得你驾驭得非常好！\n很有那种冷艳帅气的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "d7e54846011c21c553780f39bcd93c685391f18f59ffacc92ade73733907b0b6", "ja": "ほんと？　やった～！　……じゃなくて、\nふふふ。ありがとうございます、あなた様。", "zh": "真的吗？太好啦～！……不对，\n呵呵呵。谢谢您，阁下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a4dc0c7760a40aa9ab37af4ebbe8bea2b1628e22fbec57d4848bda0b714777cc", "ja": "う、うん？\nなんで急に、貴音みたいなしゃべり方に……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯？\n怎么突然像贵音那样说话了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "a18052a722489039a46169ed7ae8542715c5c92a0ed7a9930c3fe173d396d329", "ja": "貴音さんみたいなミステリアスなふんいき、\nわたしも出してみたいんだ。ちょっとは出せてる？", "zh": "我也想试着营造出像贵音姐姐那样神秘的氛围。有没有稍微表现出来一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "332c1b67a6cd914a679d04fd0bb6380950d4d6dbdbf8f2fe0425dfa0f0f2081f", "ja": "ああ、うん。雰囲気は出てると思うよ。\nだけど……物真似はする必要ないんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，是有那种感觉。\n不过……没必要模仿她吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "7865ecf89db54f433862645974cbf9c9d32c02b17ae9ae7d30997adb030b751c", "ja": "えっ……あんまり似てない？", "zh": "诶……不太像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1be22fd9a684c558b394567982ec49064300335d6fe57dc8399fb33239ba21e7", "ja": "似てるとか似てないじゃなくて。育ならではの\nミステリアスな感じって、あるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不是像不像的问题。我觉得，育独有的那种神秘感，还是有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "257a45887a27284fb2aea2d3998871df2f8b3564740a30944d2e2127439276d6", "ja": "えっ、そうかなあ？　いつものわたしの\nままだと、あんまりミステリアスじゃないと思う……。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？如果还是平时的我，我觉得好像没那么神秘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b3f8b7809bf0e4209ffcd0720fb5efd5b7eead5073a0b2d1c654ae2ecc8f7a39", "ja": "でも、その衣装は育のものだし、育にしかできない\n謎の雰囲気ってあると思うんだ。少し考えてみないか？", "zh": "不过，那套服装是育的，也只有育才能营造出那种神秘的氛围。我觉得你可以稍微考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "39b573ef6f712f9e1f15d46340d89d5faa35e60dedb3003332176c0fbca5ce51", "ja": "わたしの、謎のふんいき……。\n……うーん……うぅーん？", "zh": "我的神秘氛围……\n……唔——……唔——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "df2b990d5dcbb50d202a7c3ddc1d5fbbb4452429171580b4c188b513650ff0fa", "ja": "そんな、難しく考えなくていいから。\nほんの少しの、ちょっとした事でもいいんだ。", "zh": "不用想得那么复杂。\n哪怕只是一点点小事也可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "e1e60750c97ebc19a82b0d45b9c1705e0012a4d09bd6c6472a262a3e0d0352a8", "ja": "ちょっとしたこと……。あ、わかったかも！\n{$P$}さん、きいてきいて。", "zh": "一点小事……啊，我好像明白了！\n{$P$}先生，听我说听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "2813acdbdb1a425a5851994d1fb19c5d0944921181faee3ce7dcc210804e296b", "ja": "じつはわたし、{$P$}さんに\n秘密にしてたことがひとつだけあるの。知りたい？", "zh": "其实，我对{$P$}先生一直保密着一件事。想知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1015_p", "source_sha256": "eae11660947e75f85bde3370f84ca903f73c0c3a82d2add2a8eb153c197d9ef6", "ja": "え？　い、いったいなんだろう……\n育、教えてくれるか？", "zh": "诶？到、到底是什么呢……\n小育，你能告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "56fc54294390ccac0eb2ebe24c7ada4789e1a41e6373d6ee1e2dc35bc93fd9cc", "ja": "ふふ、今はまだダメ！　わたしがもうちょっと\nおとなになったら、こっそり、おしえてあげる。", "zh": "嘿嘿，现在还不行！等我再长大一点，就偷偷告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "778691895142f8f998159865b91a44af7d721168830856ff73747c6b30405138", "ja": "なんて……どう？\nこういう感じだと、謎のふんいき、あるかな？", "zh": "之类的……怎么样？\n像这样的话，是不是有种神秘的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1018_p", "source_sha256": "88923d13df1fd67f3f238a2b442da048a2bfefa587dd0e90010b1351c42afd57", "ja": "あっ！　……なるほど、そうきたか。\nその育の謎はすごく、気になるぞ。いい雰囲気だ。", "zh": "啊！……原来如此，是这种感觉啊。\n育留下的这个谜题非常吸引人哦。气氛很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "12f5d5d4f46b8727d883e8f017bac31f17f11767a2acf2abd72600db32d99bb3", "ja": "えへへ♪　ならこんな感じで、もっともっと\n{$P$}さんを気にさせちゃうからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　那就这样，让你对{$P$}先生越来越在意吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0234_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "dc30d59913bbe737521c9f75f0a7f883b928b60e6d4627e8c96ee8a5b5f1dc3a", "ja": "次はどんな謎にしようかなぁ……？\nあっ、まだナイショだからね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "接下来要出什么样的谜题呢……？\n啊，这还要保密哦！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
